-- A function whose body is one assignment, written where it is called as a
-- statement in a release build (`backend.md` §9, *Slice 8*, *a function
-- that assigns*), does what the call did, in the same order: both builds
-- print the same four lines (`platform/Cells.beni`; the shapes are
-- `emit/release/app/SpecStatements`).
import Cells
import Node


main : Node.Program
main = Node.printLines (Cells.demo ())
